From 4016156fe7ab963ad8c95ee3000809f938eaa738 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yumi Yukimura <me.cafebabe@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 6 Sep 2026 01:05:48 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] codec2: add RGBA_8888 decoder output support

Advertise and map RGBA_8888 graphic buffers, support raw RGBA
wrapping, and convert gav1 output from planar YUV using libyuv.

Add tests for RGBA allocation, layout, and raw output buffers.

Assisted-by: OpenCode/gpt-5.6-sol
